WHY: The repository root has no package.json, so `npx vitest` run from the root does not use the repo's pinned vitest 5.0.3 under `.skilled/node_modules`. It fell back to a cached vitest 5.0.5, and with no cache and no network it fails with ENOTFOUND. Each command must call the pinned binary `.skilled/node_modules/.bin/vitest` instead.

